Alaiy
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 72 ROTATE 3 U 2
EJAED 4 FACE_ALL
EJAED 10 FACE_ALL
EJAED 1 FACE_ALL
EJAED 9 FACE_ALL
EJAED 1 FACE_ALL
EJAED 7 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE {DRAW, EJAED} EJAED
AND
    OR
        DEST Rank 1
        DEST Size < 4
    DEST Size > 0
MOVE_STACK EJAED EJAED
SRC Rank 1
$win
AND
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
